package(USEPKG G4GeoLoki LokiUtils G4Interfaces G4Launcher G4CustomPyGen SimpleHists LokiMasking LOKI GriffAnaUtils Units)

######################################################################

Regression tests (test-only package) pinning the current behaviour of the
LOKI/BCS geometry (G4GeoLoki), the pixel-id logic (AimHelper,
PixelatedBanks) and the hit -> pixel mapping used in the analyses. Contains no
production code: only a small pycpp helper module exposing internals needed by
the tests, a python helper module and test scripts with reference logs.

Run with: sb -t --testfilter='sb_g4geolokitests_*'

Primary author: milan.klausz@ess.eu
